      "content": "thanks. those are good. i noticed you used words like 'virtuosic' and 'nuanced' for the painting, but for the masks/textiles you used 'vibrant' and 'craftsmanship'. \n\nwhen we're writing the full essay, i want to make sure we're placing them correctly in the hierarchy of the exhibit. do you think the Renaissance piece should be treated as a standalone \"work of art\" in the main hall, whereas the tribal pieces might be better grouped together in a section focused on \"cultural heritage\" or \"ethnographic interest\"? i just want to make sure we don't misrepresent their intellectual depth.",
